[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10625.59, "timestamp": "02:57:05", "text": "没有任何。我确实对某人说过，我会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10628.15, "timestamp": "02:57:08", "text": "永远不要放弃你。不，不，不，绝不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10632.07, "timestamp": "02:57:12", "text": "我会让你失望的。让你看看你自己。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10634.95, "timestamp": "02:57:14", "text": "CU宕机了吗？他当时就说，他们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10637.429, "timestamp": "02:57:17", "text": "他们当时就想：“啊？你要去吗？”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10640.23, "timestamp": "02:57:20", "text": "你要把我重新加载吗？我反对里克"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10642.55, "timestamp": "02:57:22", "text": "卷。你要把我重新拉黑。”而我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10645.429, "timestamp": "02:57:25", "text": "我当时就想，“啊？什么？我其实……”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10648.389, "timestamp": "02:57:28", "text": "我说的都是真的。哟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10651.67, "timestamp": "02:57:31", "text": "哦，我不是在玩Rickroll。然后我慢慢地"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10655.19, "timestamp": "02:57:35", "text": "了解了什么是 Rickroll 之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10657.99, "timestamp": "02:57:37", "text": "是的。你也是。是的。你好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10660.55, "timestamp": "02:57:40", "text": "三三。你好吗？希望你一切顺利"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10662.15, "timestamp": "02:57:42", "text": "出色地。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10664.79, "timestamp": "02:57:44", "text": "我们当时感觉好像要等1分钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10667.67, "timestamp": "02:57:47", "text": "直播需要 1 小时 45 分钟。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10671.429, "timestamp": "02:57:51", "text": "实际上这样做是为了玩游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10673.99, "timestamp": "02:57:53", "text": "因为游戏更新了，所以就暂停了。我没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10676.15, "timestamp": "02:57:56", "text": "获取更新。而目前，正如我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10679.99, "timestamp": "02:57:59", "text": "呃，我甚至都无法启动游戏。"}]